{"body":{"text":["The session read the web chassis and components with a blank reader, and let go of the glue it could without the author's weighing: the chassis's test drawing with components of its own; the tokens and what the chassis itself makes given the chassis's look; links made in one place, as the page keeps its address, and no component reading the address; the breadcrumb one read of wholes and the start one of roots, functions written in the language; the components handing the chassis what it needs in one call, the chassis finding by type itself and giving no answer the same as the last; a picked component written strictly; a holon said in one read. A second reader's notes were mended, and 258 tests passed. It left for the author a card's summary written in the language, asking as state in the field, a card as a component, keeping what was shown done four ways, and the holon decoded in five places."]},"id":"1M83T7F6NKH4000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
